WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.859
When a vision-language-action model predicts an action chunk, the world can change before it finishes.

00:00:05.859 --> 00:00:10.212
A missed grasp or a new command can make every remaining action stale.

00:00:10.212 --> 00:00:16.227
Radeon V L A Reflex makes execution interruptible, failure-aware, and recoverable.

00:00:16.227 --> 00:00:20.725
Our testbed is language-guided fruit sorting with a Franka robot in Genesis.

00:00:20.725 --> 00:00:27.834
Five fruits and four language-addressable bowls form twenty registered tasks with exact, auditable instructions.

00:00:27.834 --> 00:00:34.140
Smol V L A receives world and wrist cameras, nine-dimensional robot state, and natural language.

00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:37.477
It predicts joint-position actions for the arm and gripper.

00:00:37.477 --> 00:00:41.651
Every action passes joint-limit and rate checks before execution.

00:00:41.651 --> 00:00:43.917
Each command carries a version number.

00:00:43.917 --> 00:00:48.604
If the operator changes the destination, the old chunk is invalidated immediately.

00:00:48.604 --> 00:00:55.301
The robot holds safely, clears cached actions, and starts the new command without completing revoked intent.

00:00:55.301 --> 00:01:03.861
Training uses our Physical Two K release: two thousand successful episodes and four hundred sixty-eight thousand eight hundred eighty-nine frames.

00:01:03.861 --> 00:01:09.843
Each of the twenty tasks has one hundred demonstrations, independent seeds, and strict-physics certificates.

00:01:09.843 --> 00:01:15.100
Kinematic grasp attachment, object teleportation, and placement nudges are disabled.

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:18.270
Runtime guards reject rigid-body pose writes.

00:01:18.270 --> 00:01:22.522
All two thousand certificates pass with zero errors and zero warnings.

00:01:22.522 --> 00:01:28.649
Simulation, collection, training, and evaluation run on one AMD Radeon GPU.

00:01:28.649 --> 00:01:37.399
The stack uses ROCm seven point two, PyTorch two point nine point one, Genesis one point one point two, and LeRobot zero point six.

00:01:37.399 --> 00:01:40.781
Training reaches about two hundred thousand cumulative steps.

00:01:40.781 --> 00:01:47.946
The final one-hundred-thousand-step continuation takes three hours and forty-five minutes at about thirty samples per second.

00:01:47.946 --> 00:01:53.872
Peak training memory is two point two two gigabytes, and final loss is zero point zero five eight.

00:01:53.872 --> 00:01:59.207
Watch the learned controller approach, grasp, lift, transport, and release.

00:01:59.207 --> 00:02:03.638
Success counts only when the correct fruit settles inside the requested bowl.

00:02:03.638 --> 00:02:06.997
No post-processing moves the object after release.

00:02:06.997 --> 00:02:14.185
After an empty grasp, Precision Reflex runs bounded geometric recovery under the same strict-physics restrictions.

00:02:14.185 --> 00:02:19.207
Learned first-attempt success and deterministic recovery are always reported separately.

00:02:19.207 --> 00:02:25.580
The formal benchmark freezes one model hash and tests all twenty tasks with five disjoint seeds each.

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:29.241
Learned control succeeds first on thirty-six rollouts.

00:02:29.241 --> 00:02:35.312
Precision Reflex recovers fifty-five more, producing ninety-one successes out of one hundred.

00:02:35.312 --> 00:02:40.948
The ninety-five-percent Wilson interval is eighty-three point eight to ninety-five point two percent.

00:02:40.948 --> 00:02:47.779
Inference latency is four point five four milliseconds at the median and thirty-seven point two seven at P ninety-five.

00:02:47.779 --> 00:02:49.866
All nine failures remain public.

00:02:49.866 --> 00:02:55.446
An independent probe switches a banana from the white-left bowl to the blue-right bowl at step forty.

00:02:55.446 --> 00:03:01.160
The stale chunk stops with zero unprotected old-command actions, and the new target succeeds.

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:07.678
Source, Physical Two K, weights, evaluations, checksums, report, and reproduction commands are public.

00:03:07.678 --> 00:03:11.785
Results cover Genesis simulation only, with no real-robot claim.

00:03:11.785 --> 00:03:19.587
Radeon V L A Reflex shows that a useful V L A system must know how to act, when to stop, and how to recover safely.
